  "description": "About Open Source Sprint: Open Source Sprint is India's largest open source hackathon — a 24-hour building experience hosted at Malla Reddy University, Hyderabad, Telangana, on October 14–15, 2026. Powered by ElevenLabs as the Title Sponsor, the event offers ElevenLabs prizes worth ₹4.5 Lakh+, along with exciting additional prizes and swags — all with zero entry fee. Format: The event follows an Open Innovation format — there are no fixed tracks or themes. Teams are free to conceive, build, and ship any idea they're passionate about over a single, continuous 24-hour sprint, from ideation to a working prototype. Eligibility: Open to college students, freshers, and professionals Team size: 2–4 members per team No restrictions on college/organization or gender — everyone can apply Process: To get confirmed registration, register through unifesto only https://www.unifesto.app/event/oss-beyond",
