    "details": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>About Open Source Sprint:</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Open Source Sprint is India's largest open source hackathon &mdash; a 24-hour building experience hosted at Malla Reddy University, Hyderabad, Telangana, on October 14&ndash;15, 2026. Powered by ElevenLabs as the Title Sponsor, the event offers ElevenLabs prizes worth ₹4.5 Lakh+, along with exciting additional prizes and swags &mdash; all with zero entry fee.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Format:</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">The event follows an Open Innovation format &mdash; there are no fixed tracks or themes. Teams are free to conceive, build, and ship any idea they're passionate about over a single, continuous 24-hour sprint, from ideation to a working prototype.</p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Eligibility:</strong></p>\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\n<li>Open to college students, freshers, and professionals</li>\n<li>Team size: 2&ndash;4 members per team</li>\n<li>No restrictions on college/organization or gender &mdash; everyone can apply</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Process: </strong>To get confirmed registration, register through unifesto only https://www.unifesto.app/event/oss-beyond</p>\n<div class=\"reply_box\">&nbsp;</div>",
